[Info]
Name	Grand Delve
Description	A vast hall lies at the heart of this delve, wide enough for a temple that fills it. Your cave is far to the south-west; rivers of fire and still water run between the old workings. Raise something great. Build as you like; nothing here ends the game.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
Sandbox	1
SandboxRealm	GrandDelve
SandboxTarget	44000
SandboxBonus	roomTiles	36	9000	Temple	Build a temple of 36 tiles
SandboxBonus	roomTypes	8	9000	-	Own eight different kinds of room
SandboxNext	skirmish/Gloomkeep.level
[/Info]

