[Triggers]
Region	GreatHall	38	29	62	44
Region	Lake	70	38	84	50
Region	Fireworks	6	14	22	26
Region	NorthHall	40	8	53	17
Region	Gate	62	14	76	28
[Trigger]
Name	hello
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Grand Delve, master. The great hall to the north-east is the largest open space under this mountain. A temple built there will outshine anything you have raised so far.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hall
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	GreatHall
Action	message	1	The great hall. The floor is flat for as far as you can see, with room enough for a temple of any size.
Action	gold	1	500
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	lake
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Lake
Action	message	1	Still water, deep and dark. Your creatures will not cross it, so plan your halls around it.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	fire
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Fireworks
Action	message	1	A fire pit in the north-west fills this cave with light and heat.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	gate
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Gate
Action	message	1	Travellers have fitted steel doors across this passage. A hero portal lies beyond it in the north-east corner.
Action	gold	1	500
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	northHallWell
Mode	once
Cond	slabs	1	NorthHall	claimed	>=	20
Action	message	1	The north hall is yours and a spring of mana has opened in it. Claim it with a worker.
Action	terrain	46	11	46	11	manawell
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
